5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited for the training camp! To make sure it's fair and fun for everyone, we should probably check the costs and how we're getting there. What do you all think?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree, Mio dear. It is wonderful to see your enthusiasm. While costs are important, let us also ensure we choose a place where everyone feels welcome and can truly bond with one another.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should also consider the administrative burden. If the destination requires too much preparation or on-site duty, it will be unfair to the organizers. We need a balance between cost, logistics, and the workload involved.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I agree! But we also need to make sure we actually get some rest. If we're too tired, the training won't be any fun! Let's find a place where everyone can sleep soundly and feel refreshed.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with the need for balance. However, we must be extremely precise with the budget this time. We cannot afford any unexpected expenses or miscalculations. Let's make sure we have a clear picture of the actual costs.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Since we're all on the same page, let's divide the research! I'll take a look at the ""Group transport in three years of receipts"" and the ""Prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds"" to start with.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a wonderful start, Mio. I shall look into ""What the seniors say about year-groups mixing"" and the ""Attendance sheets for the away camps"" to see how we can bring everyone closer together.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll check the ""Canteen closure and last year's cooking duty"" and the ""Lottery and application for public group bookings."" I want to see exactly how much labor was required last time and how difficult the booking process is.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I'll check the ""Accounts from two clubs that went inland"" and ""Quoting terms for whole-building lets""! I want to see if renting a whole place makes it easier for everyone to relax and sleep better.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I will look into the ""Vacation timetable for the club's own hall"" and the ""Membership list against first-train times."" I want to see if we have cheaper internal options or if travel times will inflate the budget.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,That sounds like a solid plan! We've got all the bases covered. I'm curious to see if the transport costs have been consistent or if they've been creeping up over the years.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is a very thoughtful approach. I hope our findings will help us create a space where the younger members and seniors can share many happy smiles and stories together.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"It is a logical division of labor. By analyzing the booking process and the previous labor requirements, we can avoid overloading a few people with too much work. I look forward to seeing the results.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I can't wait to see what I find! If we can get a whole building, maybe we can have a big pajama party and still get plenty of sleep! This is going to be an adventure!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,Let's just make sure we don't overlook any hidden fees. I'll be focusing on the hard data to ensure our final estimate is realistic. I'll see you all after the research.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Alright! Let's all do our best with the research. I'll make sure to keep a close eye on those transport costs so we can find the best balance for everyone. See you all soon!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall do my best as well. I look forward to seeing what you all discover, and I hope we can find a place that makes everyone feel truly at home. See you soon, everyone.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the practicalities of the workload. It is essential that we don't repeat the mistakes of the past regarding organizer burnout. I will report my findings in the next round.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm going to find the coolest place for us! I'll make sure we find somewhere where we can all crash and wake up super energized for training! Bye-bye everyone!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll be thorough. We need a budget that is sustainable and transparent to avoid any further strain on the club's finances. I'll report back once I've analyzed the data.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
